## Technologies Used
- React 18
- Vite
- Tailwind CSS
- React Router
- React Context API
- CSS Animations
- Responsive design

## Color Palette
- Primary: Warm Coral (#F15B38)
- Primary Hover: Terracotta Tint (#F97A56)
- Secondary/Background: Soft Cream (#F7F3EC)
- Accent: Soft Clay (#E4C9B0)
- Text (Primary): Midnight Charcoal (#1C1C1C)
- Text (Secondary): Deep Gray (#3C3C3C)
- Alt Background: White Smoke (#FAF8F5)

## Pages Overview

### Home Page (/)
- Hero section with search functionality
- Features section explaining how Bite&Bed works
- Hosts showcase
- Experiences showcase
- Testimonials from travelers

### Search Page (/search)
- Advanced search form with location, dates, and guests
- Popular destinations

### Hosts Page (/hosts)
- Grid of local hosts with ratings and specialties

### Experiences Page (/experiences)
- Grid of local experiences with pricing and ratings

### Host Profile Page (/host-profile)
- Detailed host information
- Host's experiences
- Reviews from previous travelers

### Booking Page (/booking)
- Experience details
- Date and time selection
- Guest count
- Price calculation

### Authentication Pages
- Login page (/login)
- Signup page (/signup)

### Utility Pages
- 404 Not Found page
- Loading component
- Notification component

